# Large binaries — .exe kept in the repo (under 100MB) so Vercel serves it
# from /downloads. Migrate to GitHub Releases once the first update ships.
# The .apk, .dmg, .AppImage, .deb are still git-ignored — swap those in via
# CI (GitHub Actions workflow at .github/workflows/release.yml) or manually
# upload to public/downloads/ before pushing.
public/downloads/*.dmg
public/downloads/*.AppImage
public/downloads/*.deb
public/downloads/*.zip
